4
00:00:05,947 --> 00:00:07,601
Can you guess?

5
00:00:10,901 --> 00:00:12,043
Here's a clue.

6
00:00:12,043 --> 00:00:13,454
Floppy brown ears,

7
00:00:13,454 --> 00:00:14,798
