13
00:00:30,731 --> 00:00:32,058
Ah... ah...

14
00:00:32,608 --> 00:00:35,326
Sneeze into your elbow, Pip.

15
00:00:35,576 --> 00:00:38,052
The bendy part of your arm!

16
00:00:39,902 --> 00:00:40,825
ACHOO!

17
00:00:41,375 --> 00:00:42,827
Into your elbow!

18
00:00:42,827 --> 00:00:43,973
Hooray, Pip!

19
00:00:44,523 --> 00:00:46,057
Can you sneeze into

20
00:00:46,057 --> 00:00:47,312
